<p class="intro">Christen&amp; aims to be a quiet, reliable place for anyone who wants to learn to live as a Christian: for those just starting out, and for those who have walked the road for years. The name is Dutch for “Christian &”.</p>

<h2 id="editorial">Editorial principles</h2>
<p>We hold the Bible to be the infallible Word of God and are bound to the Reformed confessions. We choose resources that help in practical Christian living: conversion, faith and sanctification in everyday life.</p>

<h2 id="sources">Source policy</h2>
<p>Every resource on this site has been chosen deliberately. Each link tells you what you will find and who it is for. Links to other websites show the website address underneath. Most resources are in Dutch.</p>
<p>For some shop links, Christen& receives a small fee when you buy something. We state this clearly on pages with such links. It does not change the price or our choice.</p>

<h2 id="privacy">Privacy</h2>
<p>This website uses no cookies and does not track you across other websites. We only keep anonymous visitor counts with <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/">GoatCounter</a>, without cookies. Fonts are loaded from this website itself, not from external services. When you follow a link to another website, that website’s rules apply.</p>

<p>Please also read the <a href="/en/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>
